WEBVTT

00:05:29.121 --> 00:05:32.913
So there was a possibility
that this was a foreign ruler.

00:05:32.954 --> 00:05:36.413
But in fact, looking at the DNA
and looking at the tooth enamel,

00:05:36.454 --> 00:05:37.996
this was no foreign king.

00:05:38.038 --> 00:05:40.329
She was a Maya queen

00:05:40.371 --> 00:05:43.413
or some other royalty
who was probably local.

00:05:43.454 --> 00:05:47.246
We actually don't usually find
foreign kings and queens.

00:05:47.288 --> 00:05:49.371
But I told you the story
was about migrants.

00:05:49.413 --> 00:05:50.788
And it is, because, in fact,

00:05:50.829 --> 00:05:52.454
it was the commoners who moved.

00:05:52.496 --> 00:05:56.163
Up to 25 percent of the population
of every village and every city

00:05:56.204 --> 00:05:58.871
consisted of migrants --
men, women and children

00:05:58.913 --> 00:06:01.329
who'd moved, sometimes
from multiple places,